e properties around an angle (sum of angles in a triangle equals 180 degrees) allows us using the angles around a point angle finding\n\n4. Compute angle ACB: $$ angle ACB = angle ACD + angle ADB = angle ACD + angle ADB = 57 + 57 = 114 degree $$\n\n5. State the measure of angle ACB: $$ \\boxed{114} $$ degrees is the measure of angle ACB.",
